sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Bidder client
    participant H as ClientHandler
    participant P as PlaceBidService
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant E as EventPublisher
    participant O as SocketClientObserver
    H->>O: beginRequest (defer requester events)
    C->>H: PLACE_BID with requestId/sessionId/payloadJson
    H->>H: databaseLock and authorization
    H->>P: placeBid
    P->>P: per-auction lock
    P->>DB: transaction: read version/wallet and validate
    alt invalid bid
        P->>DB: rollback
        P-->>H: failure response
    else valid bid
        P->>DB: conditional price/version, bid/history, frozen funds, receipt/events
        P->>DB: commit
        P->>E: publish BID_ACCEPTED / OUTBID / extension / wallet
        E->>O: defer requester's events
        P-->>H: success response
    end
    H->>O: finishRequestAndFlush(response)
    O-->>C: response then deferred events
